<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see showers Thursday.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see showers Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Thursday were forecast to see showers, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see clouds, wind and rain with highs of 18 to 27 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see mainly cloudy skies with some showers and highs of 18 to 25 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see thundershowers with highs of 15 to 25 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
